\subsection*{Additional Deliverables (Beyond Plan)}

These were not in the original plan but were needed for the thesis:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{pallet-rights-verifier} --- Cross-chain Merkle storage proof verification
    \item \textbf{Custom pallet-revive precompile} --- Efficient contract$\rightarrow$pallet calls
    \item \textbf{snowbridge-full-setup.sh} --- Automated Ethereum bridge setup script
    \item \textbf{3-layer test architecture} --- Unit + XCM simulator + Zombienet E2E
    \item \textbf{Full Snowbridge E2E bridge} --- 2 ETH successfully bridged from Ethereum to AssetHub via Gateway $\rightarrow$ relay $\rightarrow$ Bridge Hub $\rightarrow$ AssetHub (verified 2026-03-23)
    \item \textbf{Automatic royalty propagation} --- set\_royalty\_splits extrinsic + pay\_with\_royalties distributes payments to up to 10 collaborators with basis-point precision
    \item \textbf{Scheduled auto-renewal} --- on\_initialize hook + enable\_auto\_renew/disable\_auto\_renew extrinsics process expired subscriptions automatically each block
    \item \textbf{Metadata-carrying XCM} --- query\_rights\_metadata emits complete RightsMetadata struct (pricing, royalty config, content details) for cross-chain consumers
    \item \textbf{56 unit tests} (23 original + 10 security + 5 royalty + 5 auto-renewal + 2 metadata + 11 XCM)
\end{itemize}

